[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/HUD/images/banner.jpg?v=2[/img]

[b]A quiet HUD for Build 42: it only shows things when they matter.[/b]

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Client-side display only. Nothing is sent to the server[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Add mid-save[/b][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Requires[/b][/td][td]Dazed Core[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]DazedHUD[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/HUD/images/strip.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/HUD/images/extras.png?v=2[/img]

[list]
[*][b]Status strip[/b] - seven segmented meters left of the hotbar: health, hunger, thirst, fatigue, endurance, body temperature and calm. Green, amber under 45%, red under 20%.
[*][b]Readout cards[/b] - a small card fades in over a meter when it crosses a line, moves quickly, its moodle changes, or you hover it, then fades out.
[*][b]High, Drunk and Nicotine bars[/b] - right of the hotbar, only while they apply. High reads Dazed Dank.
[*][b]Weapon tag[/b] - ammo, spare rounds, chamber lamp and condition beside your character while you aim.
[*][b]Hotbar strips[/b] - a thin condition strip under each hotbar slot and the magazine count on guns.
[/list]
Every element is Context / Always / Off in Options > Mods > Dazed Core, with opacity, scale and how long cards stay up.

[i]Mod ID: DazedHUD · Version 0.1.0[/i]
